d. If you have tried multiple times and are still failing, please contact customer support.␀Cloud access failed, which may be caused by network instability due to interference. You can try moving the printer closer to the router before you try again.␀Authorization timed out. Please make sure that your phone or PC has access to the internet, and ensure that the Bambu Studio/Bambu Handy APP is running in the foreground during the binding operation.␀Cloud access rejected. If you have tried multiple times and are still failing, please contact customer support.␀Cloud access failed; this may be caused by network instability due to interference. You can try moving the printer closer to the router before you try again.␀Failed to connect to the router, which may be caused by wireless interference or being too far away from the router. Please try again or move the printer closer to the router and try again.␀Router connection failed due to incorrect password. Please check the password and try again.␀Failed to obtain IP address, which may be caused by wireless interference resulting in data transmission failure or the DHCP address pool of the router being full. Please move the printer closer...␀System exception␀The system does not support the file system currently used by the MicroSD card. Please replace the MicroSD card or format it to FAT32.␀The MicroSD card sector data is damaged. Please use the SD card repair tool to repair or format it. If it still cannot be identified, please replace the MicroSD card.␀The device is currently upgrading. Please try again when it is idle.␀The accessory firmware does not match the printer. Please upgrade it on the "Firmware" page.␀The AMS firmware does not match the printer. Please upgrade it on the "Firmware" page.␀The preset device model in the sliced file is incompatible with the current device model. The job cannot be started.␀The nozzle diameter in sliced file is not consistent with the current nozzle setting. This file can't be printed.